# Bundling & Cheques

## Splitting invoices

- **Python only:** `core/bundling.py` `compute_bundles()` under LKR ceiling
- UI: `routes/bundling.py`, drag-and-drop in `static/js/bundling.js`
- Draft state: `bundle_drafts` until user commits

## Guardrails (`core/guardrails.py`)

- CBSL holidays (`cbsl_bank_holidays`), weekends, daily ceiling
- **No LLM** — adjust invalid dates in Python
- Preserve manual override UI when user edits cheque dates

## Reviewer (not Agent 4 in bundling)

- `agents/reviewer.py` — OpenAI SME liquidity review after Python proposal
- `VERDICT: approve` / `VERDICT: suggest_changes`
- Apply path uses guardrails + `core/bundling_intent.py`

## Commit

- `POST /bundling/commit` → `cheque`, `cheque_invoice_allocation`, `invoices.cheque_id`, `deposit_timetable`
- Vector pattern refresh on commit when `ENABLE_VECTOR_PATTERNS=true`

## Bundling assistant

- `agents/bundling_assistant.py` — OpenAI + LangChain tools (`USE_BUNDLING_TOOL_AGENT`)
- Tools call `core/bundling.py`; never bypass guardrails for auto-commit
